        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(media): backfill, CDN-expiry retry, and once-mode drain fix",
        "body": "## Problem\n\n`sync --download-media` only enqueues media downloads for messages that **arrive during that sync session** (live messages + history-sync payloads received in the run). Media attached to messages that were synced earlier is never fetched — there is no way to backfill it. On an already-synced account, `sync --download-media --once` downloads nothing even though the DB holds thousands of messages with complete media metadata and no local copy.\n\n## What this adds\n\n`wacli media backfill [--chat JID] [--limit N] [--workers N]` — scans stored messages that have downloadable metadata (`direct_path` + `media_key`) but no `local_path`, and downloads them over a single connection, reusing the existing per-message download path.\n\n```\n$ wacli media backfill --limit 5 --json\n{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"attempted\":5,\"downloaded\":5,\"failed\":0,\"pending\":1024,\"skipped\":0},\"error\":null}\n```\n\n## Changes\n\n- **store**: `ListPendingMediaDownloads` / `CountPendingMediaDownloads` sqlc queries with optional chat filter and limit (newest-first; excludes revoked/deleted).\n- **app**: `BackfillMedia` worker pool with per-job panic recovery (mirrors `runMediaWorkers`, #52) and downloaded/skipped/failed accounting. `downloadMediaJob` now returns whether a file was actually fetched so counts are accurate.\n- **cmd**: `wacli media backfill` with table and `--json` output; requires a writable store.\n- **docs + CHANGELOG**.\n\n## Testing\n\n- New unit tests: `TestBackfillMediaDownloadsPending`, `TestBackfillMediaLimitAndChatFilter` (limit, chat filter, idempotent rerun, non-media rows ignored).\n- `go test -tags sqlite_fts5 ./...` green; `gofmt`/`go vet` clean.\n- Ran against a real ~79k-message DB: downloaded real files to the store media dir, pending count dropped 1024 → 1019.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WzugFsVhhytARpD9SQBbLz",
